<title>USA: Cox Communications sells certificates.</title>
<headline>Cox Communications sells certificates.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of pass-through asset trust securities from Cox Communications was offered on Friday, according to lead manager UBS Securities Inc.</p>
<p>Cox Communications is among the largest U.S. cable television operators, serving more than 3.2 million customers.</p>
<p>BORROWER COX COMMUNICATIONS INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	COUPON 5.34 PCT   MATURITY 6/15/1999</p>
<p>TYPE SECURITIES   ISS PRICE 98.038  FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2 YIELD 6.408 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P A-MINUS	 SPREAD 40 BPS     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
